<view class="page-shell friend-editor"><page-nav title="{{pageTitle}}"></page-nav><view class="editor-card card"><block wx:if="{{requestMode}}"><view class="request-intro">填写对方的 7 位 UID，发送好友申请。对方同意后，双方可查看彼此允许好友访问的足迹与简介。</view><view class="field-label">对方 UID</view><input class="text-input uid-input" type="number" placeholder="请输入 7 位 UID" maxlength="7" value="{{uid}}" data-field="uid" bindinput="input"/><view class="field-label">申请内容（必填）</view><textarea class="body-input" placeholder="可填写来意、身份或其他想说的话，内容不能为空" maxlength="120" value="{{reason}}" data-field="reason" bindinput="input" auto-height="{{true}}"/><button class="btn-primary request-save" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="save">发送好友申请</button></block><block wx:else><view class="friend-identity"><view class="friend-identity-name">{{name}}</view><view wx:if="{{bio}}" class="friend-identity-bio">{{bio}}</view><view wx:if="{{tags.length}}" class="friend-identity-tags"><text wx:for="{{tags}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view><view class="field-hint">对方的资料仅由对方本人编辑。</view></view><view class="field-label">我的备注（仅自己可见）</view><input class="text-input" placeholder="例如：学习成长同组伙伴" maxlength="30" value="{{remark}}" data-field="remark" bindinput="input"/><view class="field-hint">备注会优先显示在好友列表，不会同步给对方。</view><view class="editor-actions"><button class="delete-button" bindtap="remove">删除好友</button><button class="btn-primary save-button" bindtap="save">保存备注</button></view></block></view></view>
